window.products.push({"id":174088,"name":"Crystal Allies Specimens: 3 Mineral Starter Pack w/Natural Amethyst, Citrine, Crystal Quartz Clusters from Brazil – 1lb Specimens","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8146oM-QwmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Crystal Allies knows that since ancient times, people across different cultures have believed in the spiritual energy and protective power of stones and crystals. The different colors have different meanings, different types of minerals promote different energies, and even their placement can change the atmosphere in a room. If you are just beginning your crystal healing journey, this can be overwhelming, but it doesn’t have to be. Join Crystal Allies with this starter set, featuring 3 key and powerful stones. Amethyst’s vivid purple color catches the eye and captures the mind like no other. It is often used in meditation because of its associations with purification, protection, and divine connection. Deepening self-understanding allows one to discover and discard unhealthy habits. The warm yellow and orange tones of Citrine align it with the fire element, and thus it is believed to be an energizing stone that is stimulating and stokes inspiration. It is often associated with enhancing imagination and creativity, clearing one’s thoughts, and in turn boosting optimism and strengthening personal will. Nicknamed the “Success Stone,” it is thought to open the doors to wealth and abundance. Ranging from clear-as-water to icy white, Clear Quartz is truly a versatile stone. Its crystal-clear appearance aligns it with the concept of clarity on all levels – from clearing one’s chakras to focusing intention to achieve goals – and thus the ancients considered it a great meditation tool. Because of this, Clear Quartz is thought to be a means of cleansing and raising spiritual awareness. Experience the thrill of finding out how Crystal Allies Specimens speaks to you. No matter what you are seeking – energy, healing, relaxation, inspiration, balance, or inner peace – you can find a powerful ally with Crystal Allies.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8146oM-QwmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crystal Allies","source_asin":"B01MDUMIES","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-174088","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MDUMIES","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MDUMIES","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
