window.products.push({"id":174124,"name":"Fireplace TV Stand for 55 65 Inch TV,Highboy Entertainment Center Console Table with 26 Inch Electric Fireplace,Farmhouse Modern Media TV Cabinet,Indu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":499.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KXulsoZnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Retro Wooden Entertainment Center with Fireplace This electric fireplace TV stand is a perfect blend of industrial and modern farmhouse. The fireplace TV console for TVs is simple and sleek design and its wood grain of the tabletop delivers a naturally aged feel and creates a cozy and retro vibe. This remarkable TV table has 2 open storage shelves and 4 closed storage cabinets, giving you plenty of storage space for your stuff.The metal mesh doors on the left and right sides of the cabinet not only offer an enclosed space but also help ventilation and heat dissipation. Specifications: Color:Rustic Brown Weight capacity:200LBS Material: MDF,Plywood,Steel net TV Stand Size:15.5\"D x 64.5\"W x 31\"H Compatibility: Farmhouse cabinet holds 32\"- 65\"TVs compatible with Samsung, Sony, Sharp, TCL, LG, Vizio,Insignia, Haier, Toshiba, Element, etc. Package Includes:TV stand,Remote control,Installation manual Modern TV Console Table for Bedroom and Living Room 1. Entertainment TV stands constructed of MDF,which can support a weight of up to 200 pounds, which increases retro industrial style to your living room. Its safe and stable base is perfect for soundbar, AV components or other media . 2. Tall TV table stand adopts a height adjustable design, and the height of the TV station can be adjusted by moving the middle panel up and down to fit for items with different sizes,providing customizable organization for media, electronics, accessories, books, or decor. 3. Cabinet door of TV stand will not pinch or make noise when closed. 4.Plug in fireplace with remote control has over temperature protection function and realistic flame effect that you can always be in a safe and warm environment, while the simulated flame makes the TV cabinet look more beautiful. 5. Vintage wood grain on the tabletop of the rustic entertainment center adds character to any contemporary home. Retro-inspired design fits in with many styles, including mid-century modern, rustic, and traditional. Complement your living space with a balance of fashion and function.It can be used as TV stand, also perfect for sofa table, hallway Table, entertainment center, media stand, storage console table, etc. 6.It is easy to install and you can assemble it yourself according to the steps in the installation manual.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KXulsoZnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZimiTeda","source_asin":"B0BLXJW3QV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-174124","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLXJW3QV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLXJW3QV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
