window.products.push({"id":174250,"name":"HALM Glass Straws - Sea Life Charity Edition - 6x 8 inch Reusable Drinking Straws with Ocean Animals - Cute Design - Dishwasher Safe - Eco-Friendly - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712fmABz+jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SEA LIFE EDITION - Discover 6 ocean animals designs in this charity edition. From every set sold, we donate to Oceancare, an organization protecting oceans and marine mammals. This set contains straws with a turtle, a jellyfish, a seahorse, a dolphin, shell and a fish. QUALITY MADE IN GERMANY - We developed a special glass that produces extremely sturdy and stable straws that are also 100% recyclable. HALM glass straws can handle both cold and heat (from -40 F° to 392 F°) so they are safe for the dishwasher, microwave and even freezer. HALM straws are produced and packaged in Germany where all employees receive fair wages and full benefits. GOOD FOR YOU AND THE PLANET - Most glass straws are made of borosilicate glass, which can never be recycled. That's why we decided to develop a different, 100% recyclable, glass straw to truly reduce our footprint. Our straws, cleaning brush and even packaging are 100% plastic-free and therefore BPA-free, meaning no dangerous toxins in your body. Our production facilities are powered by solar panels. GLASS IS BEST - Remember how refreshing soda tastes out of an old-fashioned glass bottle? Only glass straws are completely taste-neutral, unlike metal, bamboo, silicone, paper, stainless steel or plastic. The rounded glass edges, specially designed for HALM straws, ensure safety and an extra-smooth taste. EASY TO CLEAN - Glass straws, just like drinking glasses, can be easily cleaned in the dishwasher. Each set also contains a plastic-free cleaning brush for using at the sink or cleaning on the go.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712fmABz+jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HÅLM","source_asin":"B07SNGGWD8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-174250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SNGGWD8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SNGGWD8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
