window.products.push({"id":174291,"name":"3pcs Stainless Steel Pot Strainer, Pasta Strainer Hand Held Pot Drainer with Handle, Crescent Pot Strainer Fits up to 9\" Pots for Noodles Pasta Fruit ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619iWmsHKCL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"When you want to pour boiling water out of your pot, but want to leave your freshly cooked pasta or vegetables in the pot for warmth or to continue with a recipe, you can use this half moon pot drainer and do just that. Simply rest this crescent shaped pan strainer over the pot, catching it on the rim, and pour the hot water out. No more cleaning or hassling with colanders or other straining gadgets. With its handle, fry drainer makes removing fried foods from hot pans a snap. It even drains the grease as it lifts. Use it to flip food while its cooking so you only have to use one utensil. Crescent Strainer with Handle: It measures approx. 14.4 inches/ 36 cm in length, 2.5 inches/ 6.4 cm in width, crescent design will fit on most pots and pans, it is easy to use, non-directional handle allows for left and right-handed users. Double Handle Pot Strainer: It measures approx. 13 inches/ 33 cm in length, 3 inches/ 7.6 cm in width, fits different pots and pans up to 10 inches diameter, nice designed with two large handles for safe and easy straining without a colander. Hand Held Noodle Strainer with Handle Durable perforated plastic drainer with a handle that easily connects to side of pots with small pegs. Handle has a hanging hole for easy storage. Made from plastic. Specification: Pot Strainer with Handle Material: stainless steel / plastic Color: as picture shows Package Include: 1 x Crescent Grease Strainer 1 x Double Handle Pot Strainer 1 x Plastic Pot Drainer with Handle","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619iWmsHKCL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"A.DASHER","source_asin":"B0841GFJRN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-174291","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0841GFJRN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0841GFJRN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
