window.products.push({"id":174351,"name":"HPST 12-Pack Shoe Storage Boxes - Shoes Organizer for Closet - Clear Plastic Stackable Shoe Containers - Clear Shoe Boxes Stackable and Foldable For S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jZHc1AVaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"\"Look Ma, No More Mess!\" - Now shoe clutter is one less thing to worry about, thanks to Home Pro Shop's stackable shoe storage boxes. This 12-piece pack shoe organizer not only maximizes storage space but also keeps your shoes protected from dust and other unwanted dirt. It comes with a snap-tight clasp design that allows you to stack the boxes with ease, and a clear front door that makes it easy for you to find and grab the pair you need! Take your Shoe Stacking To The Next Level - Is your favorite footwear gathering dust? Time to get your hands on our stackable shoe containers! Each of the shoe boxes has a unit dimension of L13.19 x W9 x H5.6 inch that can fit different types of footwear, with shoes size of up to 9 inches- heels, flats, sneakers, flip flops, sandals, wedges and more. Our clear shoe boxes also come in 7 alluring colours to complement any decor! Store Anything, Stack Anywhere - More than just a sneaker storage or a shoe organizer for closet, our clear plastic stackable containers are ideal for organizing just about any small item at home. You can store craft supplies, scarves, books, toys, tools and other small things that usually cause clutter. These foldable storage bins fit every corner to a T- your bedroom, living room, bathroom, kitchen, kid’s room, etc.. Your Shoes, Our Business - Your shoes are valuable to you. That's why we made it our business to give them utmost protection. Our shoes organizer keeps your shoes dust-free and has a large ventilation hole to ensure air circulation and odor prevention. With its durable shatter-resistant foldable plastic and hard abs front frame, our shoe storage boxes are made to last a long, long time. Our Promise - We have designed this product keeping quality in mind. Your lifetime warranty is included with this purchase. In the rare circumstance that you are not completely satisfied with this product, it can be returned for a full refund. We are always available to our customers should any issue arise.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jZHc1AVaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HPST","source_asin":"B09B7PS9NW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-174351","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B7PS9NW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B7PS9NW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
