window.products.push({"id":174362,"name":"HOMFINE Cooling Blanket for Hot Sleepers - Both Sides Q-Max>0.45 Arc-Chill Cooling Fiber for All-Season, Breathable Soft Keep Cool Summer Blanket for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fWx3NCZOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Upgraded Cooling Technology】HOMFINE cooling blanket is made of the latest cool technology fabric of Japanese Arc-chill (Q-max>0.45), which can quickly absorb body heat and immediately reduce the skin temperature by 2~5 degrees, far exceeding other fibers. With this cooling blanket, it will keep your body cool and comfortable all night long, even on hot summer nights. The best bedding choice for hot sleepers, night sweaters, and hot flashes. 【Double Sided Cold Effect】Both sides of the cooling blanket are made of dense cooling fiber fabric, after high-strength weaving process, the cold and hot blanket has a higher specific heat capacity and can dissipate heat efficiently and quickly. Our blanket keeps you cool for long periods of time instead of moments. It keeps you from sweating all night and keeps dry and non-sticky. Feel delicate, soft, silky and no static blanket for you to provide the most comfortable sleeping environment. 【Breathable And Comfortable -The Best Solution of Hot Sleepers】The cooling blanket uses100% cotton as the inner filling, which has very good air permeability and softness. The cooling comforter also automatically adjusts the cooling temperature according to your body temperature. Our light and cool blankets is not only a great choice for staying cool in hot summer months, but also a great choice for keeping you warm in spring and fall. 【Versatile Usage Scenarios】Available in 5 different sizes/color options, you can choose according to the size of bed and the decoration of room. 【Throw - 50\"x70\"】【Twin - 60\"x90\"】【Queen - 90\"x90\"】【King - 108\"x90\"】& 【Blue】【Pink】【Green】【Orange】【Purple】. Cooling blanket is very lightweight and easy to carry. Not only can you use it while sleeping, but you can also use it while reading, relaxing or meditating, or take it with you on your car trips, air trips and camping vacations. 【Easy Care Cooling Blanket】Our cooling blankets is hand and machine washable. Precise single-needle quilting technology keeps the filling in place, ensuring it won't lose its shape or shift after repeated washing in the washing machine. We recommend using a mild detergent and putting it in a laundry bag to prevent tangling and damage. Washing and Care Instructions: Light wash <30℃, do not bleach, do not iron, do not dry clean, hang in a cool place. 【Worry-Free Satisfaction Service】We offer 30 days free returns and exchanges. If you have any questions when you receive the product, please feel free to contact us, we will solve the problem for you immediately. We will ensure you have a pleasant shopping experience!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fWx3NCZOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMFINE","source_asin":"B0BNT8CPJF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-174362","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNT8CPJF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNT8CPJF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
