window.products.push({"id":174364,"name":"Department 56 Snow Village SVPD Precinct 76 Lit House","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nJBGxUVkL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Department 56 Villages set the gold standard for Holiday lit houses. Welcome to The Original Snow Village. Built with the same traditions and values found in small towns across America - the shops and neighborhoods of Main Street, U.S.A., continue to prosper and grow.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nJBGxUVkL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B003IPE3PW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-174364","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003IPE3PW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003IPE3PW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":174365,"name":"Crystal 5 oz Retro Nick and Nora Coupe Glasses | Set of 4 | Vintage Bar Glassware for Martini, Manhattan, Cosmopolitan, Classic 4 oz Cocktail Drinks |","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Q0UiDIeoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CLASSIC SIZE – Nick and Nora Charles were a stylish detective couple from the Golden Age of Hollywood. Neither of them was ever far from their current or next classic cocktail, always served in chic mini coupes. Measuring 5 oz to the rim these vintage Nick and Nora glasses are perfect for your favorite 4 oz old fashioned cocktail such as Martini, Manhattan, Cosmopolitan, Boulevardier, Sidecar. The extra 1 oz gives you freedom to walk and talk without worrying about sloshing your drink around. SMART SHAPE – just as their namesake couple these retro coupes are not only stylish but have the smarts too. As classic three-ingredient cocktails are meant to be shaken, strained and served without ice these elegant “up” coupes are designed to keep the drink cold longer by exposing less surface area to room temperature and holding smaller amount of liquid within the slightly thicker glass walls. TIMELESS ELEGANCE - crafted by award winning glass masters from pure clear crystal glass these long stemmed Nick and Nora coupe glasses are a pleasure to hold and to look at. Gracefully tall and petite while featuring a durable stem they feel good in both man’s and woman’s hand. Dishwasher friendly for an easy cleanup. SOPHISTICATED GIFT – every set of 4 vintage coupe glasses comes neatly packed in our luxurious black and white movies inspired gift box with a few of our favorite classic cocktail recipes on the back. Perfectly unique gift idea for wedding, engagement, anniversary, housewarming, retirement, birthday, Christmas or fabulous yourself. STORAGE BOX – our gift box can also be used as an ideal cocktail glasses storage container. The silky smooth shape matching cloth carefully secures each coupe in place and protects it from dust, scratching and breaking. Pack tuck away and save the precious space in your bar and kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Q0UiDIeoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GLASSIQUE CADEAU","source_asin":"B089W6Q5CF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-174365","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089W6Q5CF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089W6Q5CF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":174366,"name":"uxcell Fleece Plaid Blanket Soft Warm Fuzzy Plush Flannel Bed Blankets Lightweight Blanket for Bed, Couch, Sofa, Chair, Camping, Beach, Travel, Blue P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TBmfzqLaL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"❤ HIGH-QUALITY MATERIAL - Our fleece plaid blanket is made of 100% polyester, new-generation printing and dying technology, high color fastness, and it is treated with a sanding process that produces an super soft texture to its surface. So it is not easy to sheds, fade, shrinkage or pilling. The flannel blanket is NOT THICK BLANKET. And it is NOT ELECTRIC BLANKET or NOT HEATED BLANKET. Please kindly noted before placing an order! ❤ SPECIAL DESIGN - 260GSM plaid blanket with single layer design for added silky and lightweight feel.The front side of the flannel blanket has a soft microfleece in the plaid pattern which provides a stylish look and a fantastic sheen. Neat stitches enhance strong connections at seams and better structural strength. ❤ PERFECT SIZE - Twin Size Blanket: 59\" x 78\" (150 x 200cm), We recommend that you use the extra large throw blanket in the spring, summer and autumn, it is perfect to be used snugging when you're relaxing on the couch or for single bed. ❤ EASY WASH AND CARE - Machine washes below 30°cold water separately on gentle/delicate cycle. Tumble dry at a low temperature. .Do not /do not Iron /do not dry cleaning. The fleece blanket will be softer if use little softener when soak. Soaking time within 30 minutes. Hang dry if you want to keep the it extra fuzzy. Line drying the blanket is also recommended. Easily coordinates or enhances existing bedding or home décor.If you have any issue with our blanket, do not hesitate to contact us as your satisfaction is important. We'll work with you to resolve any issue and ensure that you're satisfied with your experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TBmfzqLaL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"uxcell","source_asin":"B08HN8JSPY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-174366","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HN8JSPY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HN8JSPY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":174367,"name":"Luigi Bormioli Prezioso Bottle, 34 oz, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+ilvhM0IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Prezioso Collection is made in Italy of Sparkx Break Resistant Glass. Luigi Bormioli's proprietary Sparkx glassware formula results in glass that is both ultra-clear and durable. The Prezioso Bottle with Stainless Steel closure features a transparent blue color that is permanent and dishwasher safe as well as a unique optic design with an infusion of angles. This bottle is not only stylish but functional as well, making it perfect for any occasion. Measures 12 3/4 inches tall with a 34-ounce capacity.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+ilvhM0IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luigi Bormioli","source_asin":"B019J0EIU4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-174367","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019J0EIU4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019J0EIU4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":174368,"name":"Mato & Hash Reusable Grocery Bags | Foldable w/Integrated String Pouch | Ripstop Nylon Tote","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dOuX9AMzL._AC_UL1024_.jpg","description":"Nylon Nylon lining Hand Wash Only *PERFECT SIZE - The size of these reusable grocery bags is ideal for shopping. Extremely similar in size to a regular plastic grocery bag, these are big enough to carry many of items safely and securely, while being small enough to remain comfortably lightweight. You do not have to worry about the bagger at the store loading too many items into your bag making it overly heavy and uncomfortable to carry. Bag Dimensions: 13\"W x 15.5\"H. Handle Dimensions: 2.75\"W X 6.3\"H *FOLDABLE CONVENIENCE - These reusable shopping bags are equipped with their own integrated string pouch. You will not have to worry about finding extra room to store these bags. Folding down into the size of a small tennis ball, you will have room for these in your purse, car, or wherever is most convenient for you so you don't forget to grab your grocery bags on your next shopping trip. Dimensions of folded pouch: 4.5\"W X 5.7\"H *STURDY + LIGHTWEIGHT - The 100% 210T Ripstop Nylon fabric that these shopping totes are made of is the ideal fabric for shopping bags. It is a lightweight fabric that is also very sturdy and resistant to rips. Ripstop Nylon is known to hold heavy loads safely, feel free to load up on as many items you can fit and carry them comfortably. *WASHABLE - Being washable is necessary for any reusable grocery bags. We recommend hand-washing these with mild detergent, and hanging to dry. *QUALITY + VALUE - As always, Mato & Hash provides some of the best quality reusable grocery bags on the market at a very competitive price. You are unlikely to find a better bang for your buck. Whether you need just a few for your next shopping trip, or a bulk amount for a promotional event, we've got you covered. Available in many different colors. Save money on multiple piece orders with our PACKS!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dOuX9AMzL._AC_UL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mato & Hash","source_asin":"B0BS78CQ3V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-174368","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS78CQ3V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS78CQ3V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
