window.products.push({"id":174372,"name":"Bravedge 5 PCS Kitchen Knife Set, Professional Chef Knife with Ultra Sharp High Carbon Stainless Steel Blade and Integrated Ergonomic Handle, Gift Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XOUvhm57L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔪〖5-Piece Kitchen Knife Set〗 Included in this 5 pieces professional knife set are: 8'' chef knife, 8'' bread knife, 7'' santoku knife, 5'' utility knife, 3.5'' paring knife. Fine processing makes this kitchen knife set resistant to rust, stains, and corrosion. Premium material will maintain the sharpness and durability for long lasting use even with heavy daily chef work. 🔪〖Multi-functional Purpose〗This versatile knife sets can provide exceptional cutting capacity in slicing, dicing, and mincing of fruits, meat, fish, and vegetables in your kitchen. Each Bravedge knife is designed for a specific purpose and can perform well at many daily kitchen tasks. Suitable for home and professional uses, beginners or master chefs can enjoy cooking much easier. 🔪〖Premium Quality〗 Bravedge chef knife sets adopt high-carbon stainless steel and outstanding craftsmanship. The blade thickness of this knife set is 2.5 mm, with a 15-degree edge at 0.25mm on the two sides to ensure sharpness and toughness. Well-balanced, the integrated ergonomic handle can provide a comfortable grip and precise control to reduce hand fatigue and minimize wrist tension. 🔪 〖Perfect Gift Choice〗Bravedge kitchen knives come with an attractive gift box for easy storage, with a form-fitted liner keeping them securely in place. These knives can be well attached to the magnetic knife holder on the wall or stored in the knife block. This boxed knife set is an ideal present for anyone who loves cooking and can be used as Christmas, Thanksgiving, Mother's Day, Birthdays or other special days gift. 🔪〖Maintenance and Warranty〗 Please clean the knives after use with a soft cloth and warm water and dry them immediately after washing. Dishwasher safe, but manual cleaning is more recommended. Every Bravedge product includes a 30-day refund and lifelong replacement warranty. For any product problem, please don't hesitate to email us directly. We are ready to offer you the most satisfying solution at any time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XOUvhm57L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bravedge","source_asin":"B0BN3RTYLC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-174372","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN3RTYLC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN3RTYLC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
