window.products.push({"id":174378,"name":"Decorative Trinket Jewelry Keepsake Storage Box. Wooden Birch Bark Gift Boxes Butterfly.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CS8kRI9NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Birch bark box is an unusual and original gift for a woman who loves natural wood products. The box is decorated with beautifully detailed embossed pattern, the details of the box are sewn with birch bark, the surface is treated with a special compound to give shine and protection from external influences. A hinged lid makes the box even easier to use. The box is roomy enough and you can store all your favorite jewelry in it - rings, earrings, necklaces, pendants and others. The soft velvety surface of birch bark is absolutely safe for expensive jewelry, it will not scratch the soft metal. If you are engaged in needlework, the box is useful for storing buttons, beads, beads, sequins and other trifles. Birch bark products can be used to store foodstuffs - nuts, sweets, dried fruits and other food products. This is the perfect small keepsake box! Recommendations for care: Birch box it is advisable to put in a dry bright place. If the box is dirty, just wipe it with a damp sponge, you can with a weak solution of vinegar. Strong dirt can be gently washed with running water using dishwashing detergent, then wipe with a napkin and dry. Do not soak the box in water, and do not store Your birch bark products near heaters.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CS8kRI9NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tourmania","source_asin":"B07RGKNHVL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-174378","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RGKNHVL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RGKNHVL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
