window.products.push({"id":174399,"name":"Beddy's All in One Zippered Bed Set, Bedding Mattress Cover, Minky Lined Sheets and Zipper Comforter Set, Checked Out (Minky), Full","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LuIh0nI5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ALL-IN-ONE BED SET: Beddy's is all you need (and even more!). Our zipper bedding comes in one piece and goes on like a fitted sheet. The set includes a zip up comforter, sewn-in sheet, comfort panels, fitted pillowcase and sham. BED-EASE: Say hello to the bed that practically makes itself. Make your morning routine a breeze or get your kids to finally start making their bed. All it takes is just one tug of the quick pull zippers and your bed will be perfectly made, every time. UPGRADED COMFORT: Don't lose sleep over your bedding. Premium materials are soft on your skin with extended comfort panels that give you coverage against zippers. Meanwhile, the heavy duty elastic bottom keeps everything in place throughout the night, even for the most restless sleepers MATERIALS: Exterior fabric is 100% cotton with a game-changing cozy Minky interior... You have no idea how much you need this in your life. Trust us. Beddy’s wash up beautifully and are easy to wash in every machine. SIZING: Beddy's are tailored to fit standard sized mattresses but may also fit RV and international sizes. For non-standard sizes +6 inches deep, choose the set closest to the width size of your mattress. A mattress wider than Beddy’s will cause the zippers to sit on the top of the mattress, while a narrower mattress will cause the zippers to ride lower on the sides. Beddy’s on mattresses under 8 inches deep will still look nice, but may fit loosely and some zipper functionality may be lost. CARE INSTRUCTIONS: Wash in cold water on normal cycle and tumble dry on low, 1 cup of white vinegar is recommended for the first washing. Removing your Beddy’s out of the washing machine promptly will help avoid color transfer. Please do not pull the law label and washing instructions off your Beddy’s. If you would like to remove the tags, carefully cut them off using scissors. Ripping the tags off will break the seam","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LuIh0nI5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beddy's","source_asin":"B09MMM1FQ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-174399","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MMM1FQ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MMM1FQ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":174400,"name":"Worthy Liners Half Sheets Parchment Paper Pan Liner - 12\" X 16\", (250 Sheets)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51F5-rsAPZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Makes cleanup a breeze with 12 1/4 x 16 3/8(approx.) inches. Half sheets coated parchment paper pan liners! These sheets are for use in applications up to 410 degrees Fahrenheit. They are perfect for lining pans in the oven - simply place across a sheet pan or baking dish, and peel it up when finished to reveal your still-clean pan!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51F5-rsAPZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WORTHYLINERS","source_asin":"B00O9JM66E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-174400","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00O9JM66E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00O9JM66E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":174401,"name":"3PCS Sunflower Shape Mold 5 Holes Cake Lollipop Chocolate Jelly Ice Cream Cube Mold Candy Pudding Cupcake Handmade Craft Mold for Children's Party Des","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613brKzFrzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Products DescriptionsSizes: The sunflower mold has a very suitable size for kinds of desserts, which size is 4.3×7.9inch, and the sunflower's diameter is 1.5inch, the stick shape hole is 2.4inch length, and the thickness of the mold is 0.4inch.Materials: The food mold is made of 100% safe good quality food-grade silicone material, which you can feel free to use on any kinds of food, it is absolutely safe and non-toxic. The soft silicone makes the mold flexible and thick, that can extend the heat preservation time, help chocolate during the operation of the rapid solidification. And it is durable and reusable, which is easy to clean, just use water to rinse, then wind dry, that can make it use many times.Widely Applications: The mold can be used in many occasions, such as birthday party, home party, festival party, bakery, cafe,dessert shop, drink shop, baby shower, DIY shop,etc. Especially perfect for many kinds of desserts, such like children themed party dessert, lollipop, cookies, chocolate, jelly, candy, ice cream cubes or cake decorations. Also perfect for handmade soap or handmade wax or any other handmade artcraft. Its adorable sunflower shape will be loved by any people.Product Attributions: Each mold is soft but sturdy, durable and elastic so that you can pull or twist it freely minded. And the special heat resistance of it, which can be used over a wide temperature range of -22℉ to +446℉(-30℃ to +230℃). You can put it in oven, freezer or microwave, etc. And it is portable and reusable with light weight baking tool, which only 38g. Each mold has 5 holes, which you can easily pop the dessert out with lightly pushing from the mould bottom.Tips: If any measurement error, please understand. Easy to clean, just use water to rinse or put it into dishwasher to wash. Silicone product, please let it stay out off fire or do not use sharp stuff to scrape it, in case of shorten its using life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613brKzFrzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMUT","source_asin":"B08ZSM5898","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-174401","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZSM5898","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZSM5898","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
