window.products.push({"id":174433,"name":"MH MYLUNE HOME Cooling Comforter Queen Size, Cooling Blanket with Arc-Chill Cooling Fiber, Cold Summer Blanket for Hot Sleepers Night Sweats and hot F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":53.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AZ2OI3XCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【 KEEP COOL THROUGHOUT THE NIGHT 】: Our cooling comforter use Japanese arc-chill cooling technology, is designed to provide relief for hot sleepers,night sweats, hot flashes. Cool to touch with a cooling value of more than 0.458,quickly reduce skin temperature 2 to 5°C. The breathable cooling fabric can wicks away sweat and moisture to keep you comfortable and dry all night long. 【 SUMMER ESSENTIAL】: With DOUBLE-SIDED cooling feature,provide a soothing and relaxing sensation that helps you drift off to sleep faster. One side made of Japanese arc-chill cooling fabric (25% PE, 75% Nylon blend), the other side is made of 100% cooling nylon. STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX certified. The ideal cold blanket for Summer Sleeping. 【SNUG FIT FOR EXTRA COMFORT】: Our cooling blanket is specially designed to contour your body for optimal comfort. With precise stitching and well distributed filling which is lightweight but not too heavy to pressure you. Cool blanket delivers an unparalleled sleep experience. Cooling comforter queen size is 79\"X86\" in. 【 VERSATILE FOR ALL SEASONS 】: This summer blanket/comforter is lightweight and breathable enough to keep you cool during hot summer nights, yet warm enough to use in the winter. Suitable for all seasons, cold blankets for sleeping are a must-have for every household! It is a portable and versatile air conditional cooling blanket as well whether you are at home/office, traveling, going camping..etc. 【 EASY CARE】 Machine washable in cold wash under 30℃/86℉. After washing, please hang it vertically on cloth hanger and dry it in a cool ventilated place(not under the sun). DO NOT PLACE IN THE DRYER. Always keep it out of heat when not use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AZ2OI3XCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MH MYLUNE HOME","source_asin":"B0C1G4MXLK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-174433","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1G4MXLK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1G4MXLK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
