window.products.push({"id":174538,"name":"Milton Brook Range Unglazed Mortar & Pestle, 6-inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UqrxO2QaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tracing its roots back to the early 20th century in England, Milton Brook has been producing some of the best loved mortar & pestles in the world. Tagged as an iconic kitchenware, Unglazed Mortar and Pestle delivers a strong practical purpose. Designed for comfort and ease of use, the mortar and pestle with their characteristic unglazed finish and beechwood handles, are excellent for crushing and grinding of herbs and spices in the traditional manner. The mortar and pestle are of high quality and does not stain, absorb or transfer odors or tastes to the next task. Made from vitrified electrical porcelain, the mortar and pestles have a strong structure and density making them dishwasher, freezer and oven proof. The set is also available in six different sizes, each holding different capacities to meet various consumer needs. Milton Brook by Wade Ceramics brand has been synonymous with indispensable pieces of kitchenware and has focused on crafting products of highest quality, using the finest British raw materials and skilled workmanship. The company continues a rich tradition of over 200 years of traditional English cooking and showcases its expertise in each iconic mortar and pestle. Truly a market leader in design and production of high-quality ceramic products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UqrxO2QaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wade Ceramics","source_asin":"B00P3EJS92","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-174538","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00P3EJS92","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00P3EJS92","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":174539,"name":"Melange 18-Piece Square Porcelain Dinnerware Set (White) | Service for 6 | Microwave, Dishwasher & Oven Safe | Dinner Plate, Salad Plate, Soup Bowl (6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fofEslPFL._SL1390_.jpg","description":"An everyday porcelain dinnerware set designed to last and impress your guests, crown that dinner party, or upgrade your everyday dinnerware with an elegant porcelain dinner set that epitomizes durability. We've combined high-quality porcelain with a unique chip-resistant design to create a dinner set that you can use every single day without dealing with constant cracking, flaking, or chipping. - vitrified at temperatures of over 2480F. - microwave, oven and dishwasher safe. - 0 percent porosity for greater durability. - complete set for service of 4 or 6 or 8 or 12. - elegant patterns and lovely glaze. For daily use no dealing with fragile dinner sets that you only whip out whenever you have company. Mélange dinnerware is strong enough to handle the rigors of daily use. You can safely use it in the microwave, clean it in the dishwasher without breaking, and even use it to reheat food in the oven up to 400F everything you need every set comes with a dinner plate, salad plate, soup bowl and maybe a Mug; everything you need to serve your family or guests a full course meal. Understated elegance simple yet eye-catching, our range of designs exude an effortless elegance that blends into just about any setting. Beautifully done detailing meets lovely colors and a well-done glaze to create porcelain place settings with a premium feel. Get one set for yourself and a couple more as Gifts and experience the Magic of Mélange. About Mélange Mélange dinnerware is all about treating you to everyday elegance. We Believe fine dinner sets shouldn’t mean fragile dinner sets. We Believe every meal should be complemented by dinnerware that makes you smile. That's why we’ve used premium materials to bring on the durability, special craftsmanship to enhance the longevity, and lovely detailing to catch anyone’s eye.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fofEslPFL._SL1390_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FERGRELMAABBCC","source_asin":"B07HS9XT9Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-174539","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HS9XT9Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HS9XT9Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":174540,"name":"Five Queens Court Lafayette 4 Piece Comforter Set, Silver, Queen 92X96","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":250.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1XCsV1+QOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Rich tones of silver, platinum and tones of pewter set the background for this ornate silver large scale iron gate damask. The design has been given a subtle antique finish along with a special washed finish to give it a relaxed appeal. The entire ensemble boasts a great deal of attention to many decorator details. Sold as a complete ensemble, the comforter set includes one comforter, one tailored bedskirt and two pillow shams. The dramatic comforter highlights the grand scale iron gate damask. It is trimmed with a subtle textured 11/2” satin fabric pleated flange and reverses to a solid, matching fabric. The bedskirt included in the ensemble has an 15”drop. It features a 4” delicately designed border, attached along the bottom edge to give a very unique and finished look. Two pillow shams are included in the comforter set. Special attention has been given to the cutting and sewing of these luxurious accents. Each sham has the large iron gate damask perfectly centered, insuring that all shams are identical. A custom 1½” pleated flange, made from the textured satin, frames all sides. To give the shams multiple looks, the reverse uses the diamond coordinating fabric, giving the option of displaying either side. The shams have “hidden zipper closures” for a clean tailored look. Both pillow shams have 5oz. padding on the face for extra comfort and luxury.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1XCsV1+QOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Five Queens Court","source_asin":"B08FD5C8VH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-174540","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FD5C8VH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FD5C8VH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":174541,"name":"AOSKY Cordless Roller Shades Blackout Blinds for Windows Room Darkening Rolled Up Shades with Spring System, UV Protection Window Shades Door Blinds f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51y9jtzkqJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Excellent Material】：AOSKY cordless roller shades made of 100% polyester material fabrics with reinforce thermal insulated coating, feeling soft and smooth. No burrs, strong wear resistance, and easy to clean.Our blackout blinds block 100% of sunlight and UV rays. The thermal backing reduces the loss of room heat and against cold through the windows in winter and summer, helping to reduce your energy bills. 【New Innovative Design】: The cordless design is safer for kids and pets. The cordless roller blinds are more convenient than corded roller blinds. Built-in the robust spring-loaded mechanism, which has passed 5,000 times usual lifting or pulling down tests for each blind, You can stop the shade wherever you want smoothly. Open the roller blind, pull it to the place; Shut the roller blind, you can gently pull the buckle, and the roller blind would automatically close. 【How to choose right size】：To make sure to cover the entire window, outside mount shades need to be 4 inches wider than windows wide. If your windows width is 30\", order size 34\" would be okay for outside mount；If your windows are 30\" wide, order 30\" or slightly less for internal installation. Don't worry window blinds height,it can adjust from 0\" to 72\". （Pls Note）：Fabric width will be 1\" narrower than the size of the shade. 【Convenient Installation】： The width of our product including the size of the mounting bracket and at least 2 inches of frame depth is required for installation. Our product comes with an installation package that includes installation instructions, installation screws, metal brackets, to help you install the product quickly.（In addition to the paper instructions included in the package, our installation video will guide you through the installation. If you encounter any problems, please contact us in the first instance and we will give you a satisfactory solution） 【How to adjust the rebound position and rebound speed of roller blinds？】： Adjusting the rebound speed: open the right side cover and adjust the screw clockwise to make the rebound speed slower and counterclockwise to make it faster. Adjusting the rebound position: open the left hood and adjust the screw counterclockwise to stop the roller blinds in the desired position and return to this position when contracting the roller shades. 【Package Include】Our curtain fabric includes a roller blind, a set of accessories. Note: If you are missing accessories or have any problems, please contact us and we will provide you with a satisfactory solution within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51y9jtzkqJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AOSKY","source_asin":"B0BF979NYR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-174541","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF979NYR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF979NYR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
