window.products.push({"id":174595,"name":"Aidek Skincare Fridge - Mini Fridge for Skin Care，Makeup, Cosmetic, Bedroom, 4 Liter/6 Can Portable Small Refrigerator with Cool& Heat Function, AC/DC","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sVeHn1WnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multifunctional-AIDEK mini fridge has cooling and warming functions.The cosmetic fridge makes your drinks and skincare products cool within 1 hour and heats food and milk within 1 hour as well. The make up fridge is the perfect place to store chocolate, snack， moisturizers, serums and eye creams that you fear might melt and make a mess. And it could make the milk, coffee really warm, but will not make it super hot. Portable-The AIDEK beauty fridge works with any 100-120V home power supplies and 12V car power supplies. This kind of design is perfect for home used and the fan of road trips. Addition to holding skincare that needs to be refrigerated, it is great for holding just enough drinks or snacks on a road trip to last the duration of the trip. It’s portability is its greatest asset. Everyone should have a small refrigerator that can be carried with them everywhere. Superior Quite Mode: The portable electric cooler & warmer fridge features a brush-less high-grade fan with the ability to operate quietly (28 dB Sleep Mode) and lasts longer.Its super quiet so you can't hear it at night if you keep it on in your room.This mini fridge for bedroom would be perfect for like breastmilk and and baby feeding Items at the bedside. 4L Portable Fridge - AIDEK 4 Liters skincare fridge can fit regular sized soda cans in it.At the same time, you can put it on your home work desk, bedroom such that you could keep a cup of milk there, and make yourself a latte very conveniently, without going to downstairs kitchen. It saves your time. Elegant and Useful- With the modern sleek design(Portable handle and Rotary switch),the mini fridge for skin care is easy to turn on and off and begin to work very quickly. No need for any special set-up. What's more, it has 3 little shelves you can attach and detach easily as needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sVeHn1WnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aidek","source_asin":"B0BB25WGW4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-174595","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BB25WGW4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BB25WGW4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
