window.products.push({"id":174724,"name":"GUUKA Vman 3-Tier Spice Rack, 14.5 Inch Non-Skid Shelf Kitchen Organizer, 3-Level Cabinet Collection for Pantry Cabinet, Bathroom or Countertop Use","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616SMF534uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Quality & Non-slip Design Homeries 3-level spice rack is finely constructed with durable plastic to bring excellent strength and long-lasting use for coming years. Meanwhile, the material is also waterproof and easy to clean, even if you accidentally make it dirty, it’s simple for a quick rinse and dry.Each tier is furnished with a non-skid surface which prevents slipping of items, ensuring your jars and bottles stay right where you placed them. The non-slip shelf lining makes sure that the glass bottles won’t slide off the rack and break in the process. It’s more convenient to use. Modern and Versatile Measuring 14.5” x 9.44” x 3.34”, the 3-tier spice shelf allows you to store and organize all of your essentials without taking up too much space on your countertops and cabinets. The three-tiered design provides sufficient space for storing the whole of your spice collection and even store some other kitchen essentials like oil or flour container. It keeps them organized well and easily accessible whenever you need, so you won’t have to go through the messy cabinets and remove the other containers to find those little spice bottles. Besides, the tiered shelves make you quickly and easily to read the labels on spice bottles, allowing for easy identification.In addition to organizing spices in the kitchen, you can also use this handy accessory to store your vitamins, herbs, aspirin or other daily medications in your bedroom; for girls and women, it can also be used to store perfume, nail polish, lotion, lipstick and other cosmetics in the bathroom, bedroom or vanity area; even in craft areas, you can also use it paint or glitter bottles.Moreover, the neutral white and gray color scheme with modern design will seamlessly blend in with any existing decor, so you don't worry no matching with your home style. In a word, you can use it throughout the home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616SMF534uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yeegfeyzz","source_asin":"B07VF5FKYY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-174724","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VF5FKYY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VF5FKYY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
